<h3><strong>Our Advantages</strong></h3>
<ul>
<li>Uniform fineness, high strength, strong combability;</li>
<li>Can be used for the production of 100% PTFE needle-punched filter media;</li>
<li>Can be customized to different density specifications such as 3.5d, 5d, 7d, etc;</li>
<li>Greatly improve the filtration efficiency of filter media under the water punching process.</li>
</ul>
<hr />
<h3>Applications</h3>
<ul>
<li><strong>Filter Media</strong>: PTFE staple fibers are commonly used in needle felt filter bags for filtration in industries such as chemical processing, power generation, and incineration.</li>
<li><strong>Textiles</strong>: They are also used in technical textiles for protective clothing and industrial fabrics that require resistance to extreme temperatures and chemicals.</li>
<li><strong>Composite Materials</strong>: PTFE fibers can be incorporated into composites for applications where chemical resistance and low friction are critical.</li>
</ul>
