<h2>Ⅲ. Shape of fibers</h2>
<p>The cross-section of Philite meta-aramid fibers is cashew-like, confirmed by the third-party detection institution, as shown in Figure 1.</p>
<p><img fetchpriority="high" decoding="async" class="alignnone  wp-image-4280" src="https://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/间位芳纶显微镜图-detail1_syy-300x226.png" alt="" width="879" height="662" srcset="https://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/间位芳纶显微镜图-detail1_syy-300x226.png 300w, https://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/间位芳纶显微镜图-detail1_syy.png 351w" sizes="(max-width: 879px) 100vw, 879px" /></p>
