<h2>IV. Thermal Decomposition Temperature</h2>
<p>The primary thermal decomposition temperature of PHILITE meta-aramid fibers is 423.94℃, confirmed by the third-party detection institution, and the TGA curve is shown in Figure 3.</p>
<p><img decoding="async" class="alignnone  wp-image-4282" src="https://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/图表-detail3-300x184.png" alt="" width="884" height="542" srcset="https://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/图表-detail3-300x184.png 300w, https://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/图表-detail3-768x471.png 768w, https://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/图表-detail3-600x368.png 600w, https://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/图表-detail3.png 991w" sizes="(max-width: 884px) 100vw, 884px" /></p>
<p>Figure 3 TGA Curve of Philite meta-aramid fibers.</p>
<h2>V. Applications</h2>
<p>Philite meta-aramid fibers own excellent comprehensive properties, such as high-temperature resistant, flame retardant, electric insulating, corrosion resistant, radiation resistant, easy spinning, easy dyeable, etc. The woven fabrics can be made into special protective clothing, which are widely used in metallurgy, construction, shipbuilding, petroleum, electric power, chemical industry, forestry, fire protection, etc. The fibers can also process into needled non-woven fabrics and woven filter fabrics in the application of the high temperature flue gas filtration, such as metallurgy, cement industry, construction industry. The needled non-woven fabrics can also be process into high temperature-resistance conveyor belt, such as endless conveyer belt and sleeve. They can also be made into textile high-speed printed carpet. The fibers can be process into insulation paper and honeycomb core by proper papermaking technology.</p>
